SIF directory licensing notice
==============================

This directory contains Security-types related work developed on top of the Vélus
compiler code base.

1. Relationship with the repository top-level LICENSE
-----------------------------------------------------

The repository top-level [LICENSE](../../LICENSE) continues to govern all
upstream Vélus material and any derivative work of that material. Nothing in
this file removes, weakens, or replaces any right, limitation, disclaimer, or
obligation stated in the repository top-level LICENSE.

In particular, if a file in this directory is in whole or in part a derivative
work of Vélus material, then distribution of that derivative work remains
subject to the same terms and conditions as the repository top-level LICENSE.

